maintained as follows.

Allowed -- does NOT make Crownutils a work based on Crownicles, and does NOT
affect Crownutils' license:

  - Reading public Crownicles data at runtime (e.g. fetching from the public
    Crownicles GitHub repository over the network) and displaying it. This is
